 canal e NÃO ESQUEÇA DE ATIVAR O SININHO!\n\nO seu feedback é fundamental pra gente!  Até a próxima, gente!\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nPODCAST | SPOTIFY E DEEZER\n\nVocê pode nos ouvir também em outras plataformas:\n\nSpotify: https://bit.ly/FFCAST\nDeezer: https://www.deezer.com/br/show/3766997\n\n-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nNos siga nas nossas outras redes:\n\nInstagram: \nFilipe Frazão: https://instagram.com/filipefrazao1\nCarol Frazão: https://instagram.com/carolbxfrazao\n\nTiktok: https://vm.tiktok.com/ZMNUoX5eF/","isCrawlable":true,"thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TyIUW9fg3F4/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEiCKgBEF5IWvKriqkDFQgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AQ==\u0026rs=AOn4CLDz_rJQvJzlrn3xjWKpPs2QghMGTw","width":168,"height":94},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TyIUW9fg3F4/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEiCMQBEG5IWvKriqkDFQgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AQ==\u0026rs=AOn4CLCotSAs3a1QQH2Qs977I5J7p87E7w","width":196,"height":110},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TyIUW9fg3F4/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEjCPYBEIoBSFryq4qpAxUIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJDeAE=\u0026rs=AOn4CLAQQVdmz_SwjS8mp7enlF1jp5NU9Q","width":246,"height":138},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TyIUW9fg3F4/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEjCNACELwBSFryq4qpAxUIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJDeAE=\u0026rs=AOn4CLCrqv0vb12HuWMSP5dj15C1JG4srg","width":336,"height":188},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/TyIUW9fg3F4/maxresdefault.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080}]},"allowRatings":true,"viewCount":"40","author":"FF HUB","isPrivate":false,"isUnpluggedCorpus":false,"isLiveContent":false,"isTvfilmVideo":false},"annotations":[{"playerAnnotationsExpandedRenderer":{"featuredChannel":{"startTimeMs":"0","endTimeMs":"363000","watermark":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/an/Rp3EuLOuWZbybSHs_qY6ww/featured_channel.jpg?v=63c4a09c","wi